newsetting auto_approve
onoff
default 1
label "Approve new and changed DLLs automatically"
tip "Off: each new or changed DLL waits for approval, asked at startup or given here. Takes effect next launch."

newsetting script_log
onoff
default 0
label "Enable copious logs"
tip "Mods' own lines in coe5mod.log too. For a mod author's bug report."

newsetting lan_rehearsal
onoff
default 0
label "Rehearse LAN games in single player"
tip "For mod authors. Content mods' scripts restart at each human turn's start and end, keeping only coe5.gameData and coe5.playerData. Writes a LAN client can't make are refused during the turn."

newsettingheader "Mac only"

newsetting mac_workshop_list
onoff
default 1
restart
label "List subscribed Workshop mods on the Mods screen"
tip "Mac only. CoE5SE lists Workshop mods for the game, which can't ask Steam. Off: only mods in ~/.coe5/mods."

newsettingheader "Windows only"

newsetting graphics_changes
onoff
default 0
restart
label "Use CoE5SE graphics changes"
tip "Enables the two options below. Off keeps native graphics and frame controls: no graphics hooks or extra menu choices. Takes effect next launch. Windows CoE5 5.43 only."

newsetting smoother_map_rendering
onoff
default 1
restart
label "Use texture array batching"
tip "Requires Use CoE5SE graphics changes. Batches map decorations at every quality with original detail and order. Off installs no rendering hooks. Takes effect next launch."

newsetting frame_controls
onoff
default 1
restart
label "Frame Rate Limiting"
tip "Requires Use CoE5SE graphics changes. Adds high-refresh FPS choices, GPU wait and optional precise pacing. Off installs no frame-control hooks or menu choices. Takes effect next launch."
